{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44949","headline":"奉酬颜使君真卿见过郭中寺寺无山水之赏故予述其意以荅焉 · 皎然","name":"奉酬颜使君真卿见过郭中寺寺无山水之赏故予述其意以荅焉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"州西柳家寺，禅舍隐人间。\n证性轻观水，栖心不买山。\n履声知客贵，云影悟身闲。\n彦会前贤事，方今可得攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}